 =?UTF-8?q?al=20+=20Netlify=20deploy=20+=205=20pontos=20blockchain?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- useBlockchain: polling Alchemy Sepolia (saldo ETH real + saldoSenhas)
  - guarda zero-address: busca ETH mesmo sem contrato deployado
- useNetworkStatus: monitor online/offline + health-check RPC 30s
- validacao.js: regras pré-tx isoladas da UI (Clean Architecture)
- erros.js: mapa ethers → PT-BR para tratamento uniforme
- Skeleton.jsx: componentes de loading (SaldoSkeleton, LinhaSkeleton)
- NetworkAlert.jsx: toast global animado (erro/aviso/sucesso/info)
- AppContext: integra hooks, expõe saldoSenhasOnChain/saldoETH/isLoadingSaldo
- MercadoLances: skeleton nos saldos + indicador status Sepolia
- CardLance: usa validarLance() unificado + prop isSepoliaOk
- web3.js: VITE_CONTRACT_ADDRESS + VITE_RPC_URL_SEPOLIA Alchemy
- netlify.toml: SPA rewrite + headers de segurança + Node 20

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
