Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(privy): troca ?? por || para capturar
 VITE_PRIVY_APP_ID vazia
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bug: ?? (nullish coalescing) só substitui null/undefined.
Se Netlify UI tiver VITE_PRIVY_APP_ID="" (vazia), ?? passa a string
